            "state": "translated",
            "value": "イディオム"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If no email app is set up, copy the address and contact us from your preferred service. Include the app version and what happened; please do not send passwords or payment details.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "メールアプリを設定していない場合は、アドレスをコピーして、普段お使いのサービスからお問い合わせください。アプリのバージョンと問題の内容をお知らせください。パスワードや決済情報は送らないでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the price is unavailable, check your connection and use Reload price on the purchase screen. The free collection remains available.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "価格が表示されない場合は、接続を確認して、購入画面の「価格を再読み込み」を押してください。無料の表現は引き続き学習できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In iOS Settings, open Accessibility → Read & Speak (Spoken Content on earlier iOS versions) → Voices → English. Download an Enhanced or Premium voice, then return to Izzy. Downloads may require Wi-Fi and storage space.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOSの「設定」→「アクセシビリティ」→「リーダーと読み上げ」（以前のiOSでは「読み上げコンテンツ」）→「声」→「英語」から、高品質またはプレミアムの音声をダウンロードしてIzzyに戻ってください。Wi-Fi接続と空き容量が必要になる場合があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include an example": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Include an example"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例文も読み上げる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include meanings": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Include meanings"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "意味も読み上げる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed English voices": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "端末内の英語音声"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed voices work offline. Voice availability and how natural they sound depend on your device and the voice you choose.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ダウンロード済みの音声はオフラインで使えます。選べる音声や読み上げの自然さは、端末と音声によって異なります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Intermediate": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中級"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Intervals that adapt": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "思い出しやすさに合わせた復習間隔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learn a meaning in a situation": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "場面の中で意味を学ぶ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learning approach": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "学習の進め方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learning history, saved phrases and notes stay on this device. Deleting the app removes its local data. A device backup may restore it. There is no app account to delete.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "学習履歴、保存した表現、メモはこの端末内に保存されます。アプリを削除すると、端末内のデータも削除されます。端末のバックアップから復元される場合があります。Izzyにはアカウントがないため、退会の手続きは不要です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Less transparent idioms and more nuanced or informal usage.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "意味を推測しにくいイディオムや、細かなニュアンス、くだけた使い方を含む表現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
