            "value": "学習データについて"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your selected voice is no longer installed. Automatic selection is being used until it is available again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択した音声が端末に見つかりません。再び利用できるようになるまで、別の音声を自動で選びます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Example speech uses installed system voices. Your voice choice is saved on this device. Japanese meanings for every example are bundled in the app; no text is sent for translation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例文の読み上げには端末内の音声を使い、選んだ音声も端末内に保存します。すべての例文の日本語訳はアプリに収録しており、翻訳のために文章を送信することはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review: did you remember the meaning?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "復習：意味を思い出せた？"
